node_modules
.next
next-env.d.ts
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
.vercel

# Cesium's runtime assets, ~14MB, copied out of node_modules by
# tools/copy-cesium-assets.mjs on predev and prebuild. A build artifact, not
# source: committing it would put a vendored copy of the library in history and
# make it go stale the moment the cesium version moves. Vercel runs prebuild, so
# the deploy generates it the same way a local build does.
public/cesium

# The crowd sprite sheet, written by tools/generate-crowd-sheet.mjs on predev
# and prebuild. Same reasoning as public/cesium: it is derived, not authored,
# and the generator is the source of truth. Committing it would put a second
# copy of the artwork in history that can silently disagree with the script
# that produces it. The build regenerates it, and Vercel runs prebuild.
public/crowd
